==Match==
===Summary===
[[Cristiano Ronaldo]] scored the only goal of the match in the 53rd minute for Real Madrid, a right foot free-kick from 25 yards out slightly to the left that went through a gap in the defensive wall and into the left corner of the net.<ref>{{cite news |url=https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/42370685 |title=Real Madrid 1 Gremio 0 |website=[[BBC Sport]] |publisher=British Broadcasting Corporation |date=16 December 2017 |access-date=20 December 2017}}</ref>

